                    "What they said is about proof.  Jonathan D'Souza Rauto's assessment is that Reddit still comes in last place on targeting, bidding and measurement.  Mark Bellamy of New Gen calls it a test and learn platform for us, not somewhere we would confidently put full funnel budget.  That is the problem a credit cannot solve.  A matched credit lowers the cost of trying something.  It does not make the result legible enough to defend next year's budget line.",
                    "There is also a timing trap in the offer itself.  A campaign that has to launch before 20 November is a campaign measured through the single noisiest fortnight of the retail year, when everybody's cost to reach a thousand people spikes and every channel's attribution overlaps with every other channel's.  Spend free money in that window and the read you get is the least transferable read of the whole year.",
